    <briefdescription>
<para>Zero-Heap PPM (Pulse-Position Modulation) Multi-Channel RC Receiver Decoder. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>PPM Protocol Specifications:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Single-wire pulse train consisting of 4..12 channel pulse widths (1000..2000 us).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Sync gap: Pulse width &gt; 2700 us demarcates frame boundary.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Pulse separator: Short low pulse (e.g. 300..500 us). </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
